  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- PDCardDeckGroup and PDCardDeck: new ShowLoadingIcon, LoadingMessage and ShowLoadingElapsedTime parameters turn the loading icon off (which also stops a group blocking the page while its decks load), change its message and hide its elapsed-time counter, through new Message and ShowElapsedTime parameters on PDCardDeckLoadingIcon. The icon's colour is the new --pd-carddeck-loading-color CSS variable, defaulting to --bs-emphasis-color, so it follows Bootstrap 5.3 dark mode instead of always being black. A deck now loads its cards and joins its group before it downloads its script, so a full page load no longer shows the loading icon while the script downloads, and its cards can be dragged once the script's drop listener is in place.",
